{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價普遍較高。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合145.56元，比本港收市高0.86元。工商銀行7.49元，與本港收市價持平。建設銀行9.81元，高3仙。友邦保險73.06元，高0.36元。港交所373元，高0.6元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股412元，高1.6元。阿里巴巴106.54元，高1.64元。理想汽車46.81元，高1.17元。金沙中國11.36元，高4仙。長和65.29元，低0.16元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T22:39:15.457778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T01:28:24.301325+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T22:37:48.247317+00:00","content_hash":"516fd43569a89ca25a73ee490845a0d1ec0658a5413d310a8e72c8b50963cb59","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}